stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> draft
  draft --> scaffold_contract_ready: approve scaffold contract
  scaffold_contract_ready --> scaffold_initializing: start or resume
  scaffold_initializing --> scaffold_blocked_with_context: recoverable blocker
  scaffold_blocked_with_context --> scaffold_initializing: retry
  scaffold_initializing --> scaffold_ready: requested phases satisfied
  scaffold_ready --> domain_intake: explicit Start Product
  scaffold_blocked_with_context --> domain_intake: explicit continue with context
  domain_intake --> product_foundation: approve domain contract
  product_foundation --> preview_ready: product validation and release
  scaffold_ready --> [*]: stop after technical foundation
